"of the PALACE MAVEN, SPENSER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:500
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserFirstIntro"
msgid ""
"SPENSER: My physical being is with\n"
"POKéMON always!\p"
"My heart beats as one with\n"
"POKéMON always!\p"
"Young one of a TRAINER!\n"
"Do you believe in your POKéMON?\p"
"Can you believe them through\n"
"and through?\p"
"If your bonds of trust are frail,\n"
"you will never beat my brethren!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:512
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_ProveYourBondWithMons"
msgid ""
"The bond you share with your POKéMON!\n"
"Prove it to me here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:516
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserPostSilverBattle"
msgid ""
"SPENSER: Gwahahah!\p"
"Hah, you never fell for my bluster!\n"
"Sorry for trying that stunt!\p"
"Here!\n"
"Bring me the thing!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:523
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_LetsSeeFrontierPass"
msgid ""
"My, my, if only you could maintain that\n"
"facade of distinguished authority…\p"
"Here!\n"
"Let's see your FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:529
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_ReceivedSpiritsSymbol"
msgid ""
"The Spirits Symbol was embossed on\n"
"the FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:533
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserAwaitNextTime"
msgid ""
"SPENSER: Your POKéMON's eyes are \n"
"truly clear and unclouded.\p"
"I will eagerly await the next\n"
"opportunity to see you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:539
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserThisTimeWontHoldBack"
msgid ""
"SPENSER: Gwahahah!\n"
"You've battled your way up again?\p"
"You must have developed a truly\n"
"formidable bond with your POKéMON.\p"
"So be it!\p"
"This time, I won't bluster or hold back.\n"
"This time, there's no fooling around.\p"
"Ready now?\n"
"Prepare to lose!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:550
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_Kaaah"
msgid "… … …Kaaah!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:553
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserYourTeamIsAdmirable"
msgid ""
"SPENSER: Well, that was some display!\n"
"Even fully unleashed, my brethren\l"
"could not overpower you.\p"
"Your team spirit is truly admirable!\p"
"Here!\n"
"Bring me that thing, will you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:561
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_HurryWithFrontierPass"
msgid ""
"My, my, if only you could maintain\n"
"a certain level of decorum…\p"
"Gaaah, here!\n"
"Hurry with that FRONTIER PASS, you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:567
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpiritsSymbolTookGoldenShine"
msgid ""
"The Spirits Symbol took on\n"
"a golden shine!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom/scripts.inc:571
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserComeSeeMeAgain"
msgid ""
"SPENSER: Gwahahah!\p"
"Come see me time and again!\n"
"My brethren and I will be waiting!$"
msgstr ""
